                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "219899822",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197970728715",
                            "num_reviews": 130,
                            "playtime_forever": 212,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 212,
                            "last_played": 1772730950
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty solid action platformer which looks inspired by the classic 90's DOS games. I feel this game missed its audience and I wish more skilled players knew about it. \n\nPros\n\n+ Movement & combat felt good\n+ You can buy various upgrades and weapons in between levels\n+ Unlike the old days, progress is saved between the levels and there are achievements\n+ Managed to get the XBOX style controller working (with a bit of fudging)\n+ Level 5 is awesome. The music and jumping on moving vehicles was fun\n+ Level 8 changes pace a bit and becomes a bit like R-Type\n+ Numerous bosses, which were enjoyable to beat\n+ Difficulty is challenging, but fair. You can lower it at any time, there are unlimited lives and if you're really bad ( like me) you get a health boost drop from the sky\n\nCons\n\n- Pretty difficult. Most achievements are skill based, so whilst I've completed the game, I've literally got one achievement (RIP)\n- I wish there was a refund feature if you don't like the weapon you bought. You kind of have to grind for more money and take the L\n- The boss of Level 7 took me ages to get past, even after I dropped down to Easy mode. The rocket damage you get almost one-shots you, regardless of difficulty.\n\nThere's a sequel out now, so will have to give that a try.\n\nOther action recommendations:\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/1647730/Zool_Redimensioned/\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/332200/Axiom_Verge/\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/111600/Serious_Sam_Double_D_XXL/?curator_clanid=37439254\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/465200/Fury_Unleashed/\n\n\n\n",
